 r←check;t;bt;l;mask;mb
 ⍝ validate user entered coordinates for Mandelbrot Set
 ⍝ Brian Becker 2006
 t←validnum'f.top'⎕WG'text' ⍝ validate top coordinate
 bt←validnum'f.bottom'⎕WG'text' ⍝ validate bottom coordinate
 l←validnum'f.left'⎕WG'text' ⍝ validate left coordinate
 →(∨/mask←0∘∊∘⍴¨t bt l)⍴err ⍝ check for any errors
 (t bt)←(t<bt)⌽t,bt ⍝ if bottom > top, swap them
 (top bottom)←t bt
 left←l
 right←left+4×(top-bottom)÷3 ⍝ calculate right cooridnate based on picture aspect ratio
 updatestack top,bottom,left,right
 updateset top,bottom,left,right
 r←1
 →0
err:
 'mb'⎕WC'msgbox' 'Invalid number'((1↓¯1↓⊃,/' ',¨(mask/'Top,' 'Bottom,' 'Left,')),((1=+/mask)⊃' are' ' is'),' not valid.')'Error'  ⍝ issue error message
 ⎕DQ'mb'
 r←0
